WEBVTT

00:00:26.004 --> 00:00:27.471
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Ah, come in.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:37.683
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Thank you.

00:00:40.298 --> 00:00:41.869
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Can you confirm your name, please?

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:44.434
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes, I’m Barbara Travers.

00:00:46.547 --> 00:00:52.034
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> OK, Miss Travers, what did you do after dinner yesterday evening?

00:00:53.797 --> 00:00:54.645
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> After dinner?

00:00:54.646 --> 00:00:58.390
I played cards with Gordon, and then I went to bed.

00:00:59.825 --> 00:01:01.329
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> What time was that?

00:01:02.744 --> 00:01:05.246
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> It was about half past eleven.

00:01:05.439 --> 00:01:07.316
I remember, I looked at my watch.

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:14.072
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you hear anything in your father’s room?

00:01:16.074 --> 00:01:17.607
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> No. I didn’t hear anything.

00:01:20.471 --> 00:01:27.606
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Miss Travers, did you have any problems with your father?

00:01:28.346 --> 00:01:32.525
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> No, I didn’t have any problems with him at all.

00:01:33.145 --> 00:01:35.838
Daddy was a wonderful man,

00:01:38.612 --> 00:01:39.899
a wonderful father.

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:50.920
Sorry, Inspector.

00:01:53.393 --> 00:01:54.601
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> OK, Miss Travers.

00:01:55.259 --> 00:01:56.640
No more questions.

00:01:56.943 --> 00:01:59.551
Could you ask Mr. Summers to come in, please?

00:01:59.783 --> 00:02:01.030
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Of course.

00:02:10.967 --> 00:02:11.860
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Mr. Summers.

00:02:13.001 --> 00:02:14.155
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Call me Gordon.

00:02:16.475 --> 00:02:19.619
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Thank you, uh … Gordon.

00:02:23.597 --> 00:02:25.157
What did you do after dinner?

00:02:26.692 --> 00:02:29.040
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> I played cards with Barbara.

00:02:29.046 --> 00:02:30.839
And then she went to bed.

00:02:33.741 --> 00:02:35.080
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you go to bed then?

00:02:35.758 --> 00:02:40.216
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> No. I stayed in the living room and then I went to bed.

00:02:42.886 --> 00:02:43.960
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> What time was that?

00:02:45.607 --> 00:02:47.770
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> I don’t remember exactly.

00:02:52.506 --> 00:02:53.814
I didn’t look at the time.

00:02:58.403 --> 00:03:00.986
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you hear anything during the night?

00:03:01.939 --> 00:03:03.514
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> No, I didn’t.

00:03:04.077 --> 00:03:05.378
I was very tired.

00:03:05.379 --> 00:03:06.545
I slept very well.

00:03:12.591 --> 00:03:16.508
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> You and Mr. Travers were business partners, weren’t you?

00:03:17.628 --> 00:03:18.875
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Yes, that’s right.

00:03:21.096 --> 00:03:26.445
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> And it’s a very good business, I understand.

00:03:28.495 --> 00:03:30.821
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Yes, Inspector, it is.

00:03:32.497 --> 00:03:34.028
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> And now it’s your business.

00:03:34.434 --> 00:03:38.904
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Listen, Inspector, I did not kill Jeremy.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:41.885
He was my partner and he was my friend.

00:03:48.153 --> 00:03:49.107
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Very well, Gordon.

00:03:51.123 --> 00:03:54.342
Could you ask Ms. Pasquale to come in, please?

00:03:55.142 --> 00:03:56.490
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Certainly.

00:04:13.002 --> 00:04:15.008
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Ah, good morning Miss...

00:04:15.488 --> 00:04:16.286
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Pasquale.

00:04:16.439 --> 00:04:17.712
Claudia Pasquale.

00:04:18.832 --> 00:04:20.339
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Take a seat, Ms. Pasquale.

00:04:20.584 --> 00:04:21.662
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Thank you.

00:04:23.315 --> 00:04:30.131
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> So, Ms. Pasquale, what did you do after dinner yesterday evening?

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:36.528
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> I went to my room and I had a bath and I went to bed.

00:04:37.495 --> 00:04:38.573
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> What time was that?

00:04:39.466 --> 00:04:40.970
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> About 11 o’clock.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.560
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you hear anything?

00:04:46.393 --> 00:04:50.108
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Yes. I heard somebody go into Jeremy’s room.

00:04:50.922 --> 00:04:52.686
It was about twelve o’clock.

00:04:53.857 --> 00:04:54.610
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Who was it?

00:04:55.736 --> 00:04:58.064
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> It was Amanda, his wife.

00:04:58.402 --> 00:05:01.020
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Are you sure? Did you see her?

00:05:01.273 --> 00:05:04.383
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Well, no, I didn’t see her.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.003
But I’m sure it was Amanda.

00:05:10.334 --> 00:05:16.606
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> You were Mr. Travers’s secretary, weren't you, Claudia?

00:05:17.413 --> 00:05:18.515
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Yes, I was.

00:05:21.114 --> 00:05:22.500
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Were you just his secretary?

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:24.486
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> What do you mean?

00:05:26.934 --> 00:05:28.880
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Were you in love with Mr. Travers, Claudia?

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:30.667
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> No, I wasn’t.

00:05:32.308 --> 00:05:33.928
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> The truth please, Claudia.

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:40.896
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Very well, Inspector.

00:05:41.714 --> 00:05:46.637
Yes, I was in love with him, and he said that he was in love with me.

00:05:47.061 --> 00:05:50.045
He said he wanted to leave his wife – Amanda – and marry me.

00:05:51.187 --> 00:05:53.691
I was stupid. I believed him.

00:05:54.322 --> 00:05:55.666
But he didn’t leave her.

00:05:56.125 --> 00:05:57.698
He used me, Inspector!

00:05:58.758 --> 00:06:00.331
I was very angry with him.

00:06:01.128 --> 00:06:02.123
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you kill him?

00:06:02.563 --> 00:06:03.861
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> No, Inspector.

00:06:04.508 --> 00:06:05.781
I loved Jeremy.